(7274224, 1132165, 38432, '<td valign="top">great, I wish the jacket colour was contrasting ...</td>', 'great, I wish the jacket colour was contrasting ...', '2014-10-16 14:37:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(7274261, 1132475, 134859, '<td valign="top">One of my top photos!  <br/> <br/>I love the red background.  Beautifully done.  <br/>in a minimal challenge, you have pulled this off quite nicely.</td>', 'One of my top photos!   I love the red background.  Beautifully done.  in a minimal challenge, you have pulled this off quite nicely.', '2014-10-16 15:48:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(7274262, 1132470, 134859, '<td valign="top">For some reason, I am drawn to this picture more than the others in the challenge.  Perhaps it''s the detail... <br/>I can''t quite put my finger on it... but it''s one of my top rated photos in the challenge.</td>', 'For some reason, I am drawn to this picture more than the others in the challenge.  Perhaps it''s the detail... I can''t quite put my finger on it... but it''s one of my top rated photos in the challenge.', '2014-10-16 15:49:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(7274368, 1132515, 175719, '<td valign="top">If it cliché with the subject matter but very well done.</td>', 'If it cliché with the subject matter but very well done.', '2014-10-16 21:06:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(7274371, 1132116, 175719, '<td valign="top">Okay this does the bit like pepper porn.</td>', 'Okay this does the bit like pepper porn.', '2014-10-16 21:10:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(7274372, 1132503, 175719, '<td valign="top">This is an incredibly beautiful shot. I wish I had seen it in the open challenge because I don''t think it''s  represents red but I love it.</td>', 'This is an incredibly beautiful shot. I wish I had seen it in the open challenge because I don''t think it''s  represents red but I love it.', '2014-10-16 21:12:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(7274373, 1132467, 175719, '<td valign="top">Subject is a bit cliché.</td>', 'Subject is a bit cliché.', '2014-10-16 21:19:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(7274374, 1132392, 175719, '<td valign="top">Good idea but not quite clean enough I know this is a minimal editing challenge but I''d like to see that a little more popped maybe the lighting  popped up a little overexposed so you can get rid of some of that facial hair.</td>', 'Good idea but not quite clean enough I know this is a minimal editing challenge but I''d like to see that a little more popped maybe the lighting  popped up a little overexposed so you can get rid of some of that facial hair.', '2014-10-16 21:24:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(7274375, 1132275, 175719, '<td valign="top">Really love this photo. I know it''s minimal editing but I''d like to see this popped up for the red is really contrasty against the white.  Good job good eye.</td>', 'Really love this photo. I know it''s minimal editing but I''d like to see this popped up for the red is really contrasty against the white.  Good job good eye.', '2014-10-16 21:26:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(7274376, 1132479, 175719, '<td valign="top">Nice shot but it''s not really red it it''s kind of  pink.</td>', 'Nice shot but it''s not really red it it''s kind of  pink.', '2014-10-16 21:28:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(7274399, 1132571, 13077, '<td valign="top">Not particularly! But I like the photo, very sharp and colorful and well lit.</td>', 'Not particularly! But I like the photo, very sharp and colorful and well lit.', '2014-10-16 22:08:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(7274400, 1132529, 13077, '<td valign="top">Not bad, but I think it would have worked better if the chilis were on a different surface or with some other things like onions or garlic, even though those aren''t red you could highlight the red peppers in the photo.<br/>I see that the cloth is red as well, but it doesn''t make a very interesting backdrop in my opinion.</td>', 'Not bad, but I think it would have worked better if the chilis were on a different surface or with some other things like onions or garlic, even though those aren''t red you could highlight the red peppers in the photo.I see that the cloth is red as well, but it doesn''t make a very interesting backdrop in my opinion.', '2014-10-16 22:10:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(7274401, 1132165, 13077, '<td valign="top">I like this angle of view - the poppies provide a very appealing surface and the man picking really stands out well.</td>', 'I like this angle of view - the poppies provide a very appealing surface and the man picking really stands out well.', '2014-10-16 22:11:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(7274402, 1132243, 13077, '<td valign="top">I don''t know how much more you might have been able to crop without losing too much detail to show at 800px, but I don''t think the faint stars warrant the moon being so small relative to the photo.</td>', 'I don''t know how much more you might have been able to crop without losing too much detail to show at 800px, but I don''t think the faint stars warrant the moon being so small relative to the photo.', '2014-10-16 22:12:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(7274403, 1132545, 13077, '<td valign="top">Nice use of the light and I like the composition.</td>', 'Nice use of the light and I like the composition.', '2014-10-16 22:12:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(7274404, 1132553, 13077, '<td valign="top">It''s an interesting mural, and sure enough you''ve found a red part.</td>', 'It''s an interesting mural, and sure enough you''ve found a red part.', '2014-10-16 22:13:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(7274405, 1132454, 13077, '<td valign="top">under his invisibility cloak, duh!</td>', 'under his invisibility cloak, duh!', '2014-10-16 22:14:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(7274406, 1132375, 13077, '<td valign="top">This seems underexposed, and I''m not crazy about the composition. Maybe a vertical shot would have worked better?</td>', 'This seems underexposed, and I''m not crazy about the composition. Maybe a vertical shot would have worked better?', '2014-10-16 22:14:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(7274407, 1132340, 13077, '<td valign="top">Are those the little shutter release buttons? Very minimalist shot here.</td>', 'Are those the little shutter release buttons? Very minimalist shot here.', '2014-10-16 22:15:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(7274408, 1132422, 13077, '<td valign="top">Lots of red! Very sharp and good composition, I like it.</td>', 'Lots of red! Very sharp and good composition, I like it.', '2014-10-16 22:15:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(7274409, 1132502, 13077, '<td valign="top">Very cool. Nicely done.</td>', 'Very cool. Nicely done.', '2014-10-16 22:15:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(7274410, 1132239, 13077, '<td valign="top">Creepy.</td>', 'Creepy.', '2014-10-16 22:16:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(7274411, 1132364, 13077, '<td valign="top">Wow, very dark and creepy. Well done, the patterns in the blood (hope you didn''t make yourself bleed just to take this) are fantastic, it looks like a font.</td>', 'Wow, very dark and creepy. Well done, the patterns in the blood (hope you didn''t make yourself bleed just to take this) are fantastic, it looks like a font.', '2014-10-16 22:17:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(7274412, 1132194, 13077, '<td valign="top">Looks delicious. Well done.</td>', 'Looks delicious. Well done.', '2014-10-16 22:17:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(7274413, 1132197, 13077, '<td valign="top">I like it. Even the very bright background is unusual but striking and works well with the tones in the rest of the frame.</td>', 'I like it. Even the very bright background is unusual but striking and works well with the tones in the rest of the frame.', '2014-10-16 22:18:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(7274414, 1132522, 13077, '<td valign="top">Good capture, I like that he''s wearing a shirt with a US flag and she''s got the UK flag leggings.</td>', 'Good capture, I like that he''s wearing a shirt with a US flag and she''s got the UK flag leggings.', '2014-10-16 22:19:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(7274415, 1132283, 13077, '<td valign="top">Wonder how many tries that took! Nicely done.</td>', 'Wonder how many tries that took! Nicely done.', '2014-10-16 22:19:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(7274417, 1132470, 13077, '<td valign="top">Bonus points for making me interested enough to google it and listen to the song.</td>', 'Bonus points for making me interested enough to google it and listen to the song.', '2014-10-16 22:21:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(7274418, 1132370, 13077, '<td valign="top">Never seen an artistic use of red-eye - great idea, and well done.</td>', 'Never seen an artistic use of red-eye - great idea, and well done.', '2014-10-16 22:21:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(7274419, 1132191, 13077, '<td valign="top">lol. Nice concept, and lots of red to be found.</td>', 'lol. Nice concept, and lots of red to be found.', '2014-10-16 22:22:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(7274421, 1132530, 13077, '<td valign="top">Nicely lit and composed. Simple and very appealing.</td>', 'Nicely lit and composed. Simple and very appealing.', '2014-10-16 22:24:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(7274422, 1132392, 13077, '<td valign="top">Excellent, my favorite so far. Very well done overall.</td>', 'Excellent, my favorite so far. Very well done overall.', '2014-10-16 22:24:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(7274603, 1132481, 163430, '<td valign="top">I wrote you a nice big comment and the bloody site lost it :-( Here i go again. I happened twice, but the second time around i had it copied to clipboard.<br/> <br/>I really like the concept, but the photographic execution is slightly under par, IMO.<br/> <br/>I like:<br/>- The separation of the red subject from the rest of the image using light and darkness. Selective colour without Photoshop :-)<br/>- The composition. The rule of thirds really works well in this image and it is used effectively.<br/>- The inclusion of the hand/finger in the  shot. It adds to the storytelling and the human element.<br/> <br/>I would prefer if:<br/>- The glass was a bit larger. Is it a glass or a candle holder or another decoration?<br/>- The glass was a standard clear wine glass filled (about 1/3) with red wine (or some red liquid) instead of the glass itself being red.<br/>- Maybe some more light on the finger, given the red fingernail. I might add to the visual impact of the image. Just maybe.<br/>- A bit more sharpness (or DoF) around the glass. The sharpest elements in the image are the finger (the part where the nail ends) and some stray hair strands.</td>', 'I wrote you a nice big comment and the bloody site lost it :-( Here i go again. I happened twice, but the second time around i had it copied to clipboard. I really like the concept, but the photographic execution is slightly under par, IMO. I like:- The separation of the red subject from the rest of the image using light and darkness. Selective colour without Photoshop :-)- The composition. The rule of thirds really works well in this image and it is used effectively.- The inclusion of the hand/finger in the  shot. It adds to the storytelling and the human element. I would prefer if:- The glass was a bit larger. Is it a glass or a candle holder or another decoration?- The glass was a standard clear wine glass filled (about 1/3) with red wine (or some red liquid) instead of the glass itself being red.- Maybe some more light on the finger, given the red fingernail. I might add to the visual impact of the image. Just maybe.- A bit more sharpness (or DoF) around the glass. The sharpest elements in the image are the finger (the part where the nail ends) and some stray hair strands.', '2014-10-17 08:33:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(7274605, 1132385, 163430, '<td valign="top">Wow. Tack-sharp image and excellent reds (colours in general) and DoF. My only remark is the composition. Slightly off-center placement of the parrot would be nicer.</td>', 'Wow. Tack-sharp image and excellent reds (colours in general) and DoF. My only remark is the composition. Slightly off-center placement of the parrot would be nicer.', '2014-10-17 08:41:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(7274606, 1132144, 163430, '<td valign="top">Nice idea and an execution to match. Awesome.<br/>For this challenge, i wandered around the town looking for graffiti with the text red (&amp;#1094;&amp;#1088;&amp;#1074;&amp;#1077;&amp;#1085;&amp;#1086; to be precise :-) written/painted in red, but couldn''t find a good one. Light painting never came to mind.<br/> <br/>The blown highlights in the brush tip are a bit distracting, but only a bit.</td>', 'Nice idea and an execution to match. Awesome.For this challenge, i wandered around the town looking for graffiti with the text red (&#1094;&#1088;&#1074;&#1077;&#1085;&#1086; to be precise :-) written/painted in red, but couldn''t find a good one. Light painting never came to mind. The blown highlights in the brush tip are a bit distracting, but only a bit.', '2014-10-17 08:46:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(7274607, 1132287, 163430, '<td valign="top">Not red enough, IMO. Maybe some different camera settings (more saturation) would emphasize the redness of the reflection.</td>', 'Not red enough, IMO. Maybe some different camera settings (more saturation) would emphasize the redness of the reflection.', '2014-10-17 08:47:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(7274608, 1132545, 163430, '<td valign="top">Very difficult shot, especially for minimal editing.<br/>I seems impossible to remove the distracting elements without altering the red elements.</td>', 'Very difficult shot, especially for minimal editing.I seems impossible to remove the distracting elements without altering the red elements.', '2014-10-17 08:50:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(7274611, 1132129, 163430, '<td valign="top">I really with the "cocktail" was at least as red as the straw. <br/>It would have been dazzling.</td>', 'I really with the "cocktail" was at least as red as the straw. It would have been dazzling.', '2014-10-17 08:52:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(7274621, 1132392, 163430, '<td valign="top">Beautiful and striking image.<br/>I imagine you had difficult time choosing the right focus point and DoF. I cannot decide for myself (if i was shooting this) what should be in focus i how much. :-)</td>', 'Beautiful and striking image.I imagine you had difficult time choosing the right focus point and DoF. I cannot decide for myself (if i was shooting this) what should be in focus i how much. :-)', '2014-10-17 10:07:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(7274622, 1132530, 163430, '<td valign="top">A bit more contrast from the background would add to the impact of the image. Fo example if the background was white(ish)</td>', 'A bit more contrast from the background would add to the impact of the image. Fo example if the background was white(ish)', '2014-10-17 10:10:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(7274623, 1132242, 163430, '<td valign="top">Beautiful. One of my top picks.<br/>A bit more contrast (whiter whites and blacker blacks :-) would benefit the image, IMO. And maybe a tad more DoF, to include the whole ace of hearts.</td>', 'Beautiful. One of my top picks.A bit more contrast (whiter whites and blacker blacks :-) would benefit the image, IMO. And maybe a tad more DoF, to include the whole ace of hearts.', '2014-10-17 10:16:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(7274632, 1132074, 118154, '<td valign="top">The red is not red on my screen, but the yellow is yellow so alls well.</td>', 'The red is not red on my screen, but the yellow is yellow so alls well.', '2014-10-17 10:38:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(7274633, 1132275, 118154, '<td valign="top">needs a bit of a pump up in my opinion</td>', 'needs a bit of a pump up in my opinion', '2014-10-17 10:40:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(7274634, 1132074, 163430, '<td valign="top">And your blood-red moon came out yellowish in camera :-(</td>', 'And your blood-red moon came out yellowish in camera :-(', '2014-10-17 10:44:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(7274635, 1132482, 163430, '<td valign="top">A bit dark for my taste, but beautiful red image, nonetheless.</td>', 'A bit dark for my taste, but beautiful red image, nonetheless.', '2014-10-17 10:45:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(7274637, 1132515, 163430, '<td valign="top">A bit dark for my taste, but beautiful red image, nonetheless.</td>', 'A bit dark for my taste, but beautiful red image, nonetheless.', '2014-10-17 10:59:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(7274638, 1132468, 163430, '<td valign="top">It''s red, alright, but i don''t get it :-(</td>', 'It''s red, alright, but i don''t get it :-(', '2014-10-17 10:59:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(7274639, 1132541, 163430, '<td valign="top">The blue tones are somehow stronger that the red ones :-(</td>', 'The blue tones are somehow stronger that the red ones :-(', '2014-10-17 11:01:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(7274640, 1132571, 163430, '<td valign="top">I have mixed emotions regarding this image. I like the redness of it, the idea and the general composition, but there are some details about the photographic execution that bother me. Major turn-offs being the tilted horizon, the white foreground not actually being white and to some extent the vignetting in the lower corners.<br/> <br/>The jury (in my head) is still out on how to vote :-)</td>', 'I have mixed emotions regarding this image. I like the redness of it, the idea and the general composition, but there are some details about the photographic execution that bother me. Major turn-offs being the tilted horizon, the white foreground not actually being white and to some extent the vignetting in the lower corners. The jury (in my head) is still out on how to vote :-)', '2014-10-17 11:05:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(7274641, 1132558, 163430, '<td valign="top">Interesting idea, but a difficult one to execute in minimal editing.</td>', 'Interesting idea, but a difficult one to execute in minimal editing.', '2014-10-17 11:06:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(7274643, 1132508, 163430, '<td valign="top">WOW. Just WOW.<br/>Not the typical red tone, but plays well with the dark mood of the image. The composition is right where it should be and the amount of detail on the leaf is astonishing. And all that in minimal editing.</td>', 'WOW. Just WOW.Not the typical red tone, but plays well with the dark mood of the image. The composition is right where it should be and the amount of detail on the leaf is astonishing. And all that in minimal editing.', '2014-10-17 11:27:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(7274645, 1132465, 163430, '<td valign="top">Bravo!<br/>Kudos to the way you managed to successfully create a striking RED image from all that yellow.</td>', 'Bravo!Kudos to the way you managed to successfully create a striking RED image from all that yellow.', '2014-10-17 11:28:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(7274646, 1132422, 163430, '<td valign="top">The reddest red image of all the red images submitted to the Red V challenge.<br/>Excellent composition. I like the way the dark stripe breaks the flow of red. The level of details is excellent as well. My only remark is that i would have preferred a bit more DoF, if possible. Just enough to include the left pat of the frame in focus. That didn''t stop to vote 10, thoug.</td>', 'The reddest red image of all the red images submitted to the Red V challenge.Excellent composition. I like the way the dark stripe breaks the flow of red. The level of details is excellent as well. My only remark is that i would have preferred a bit more DoF, if possible. Just enough to include the left pat of the frame in focus. That didn''t stop to vote 10, thoug.', '2014-10-17 11:32:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(7274647, 1132340, 163430, '<td valign="top">Cute.<br/> <br/>ETA: Did you, by any chance, had more of those ladybugs? It would have been great to have whole family of them marching in the frame :-) The negative white space works great with this image, but i would prefer if it was a bit whiter.</td>', 'Cute. ETA: Did you, by any chance, had more of those ladybugs? It would have been great to have whole family of them marching in the frame :-) The negative white space works great with this image, but i would prefer if it was a bit whiter.', '2014-10-17 11:36:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(7274713, 1132508, 13077, '<td valign="top">I like the light, the deep rich red tones and the sharpness. Well done.</td>', 'I like the light, the deep rich red tones and the sharpness. Well done.', '2014-10-17 15:09:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(7274714, 1132481, 13077, '<td valign="top">Excellent mood and composition is great. I like it a lot.</td>', 'Excellent mood and composition is great. I like it a lot.', '2014-10-17 15:09:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(7274715, 1132156, 13077, '<td valign="top">A pair of super cool mailboxes!</td>', 'A pair of super cool mailboxes!', '2014-10-17 15:09:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(7274721, 1132509, 13077, '<td valign="top">Although the subject is clearly the leaf and generally filling the frame and minimizing the other things is good, I sort of like the other things you''ve included here.<br/>It does look a bit soft, though - maybe your camera doesn''t offer sharpness adjustment so not a big deal considering the editing rules.</td>', 'Although the subject is clearly the leaf and generally filling the frame and minimizing the other things is good, I sort of like the other things you''ve included here.It does look a bit soft, though - maybe your camera doesn''t offer sharpness adjustment so not a big deal considering the editing rules.', '2014-10-17 15:36:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(7274722, 1132492, 13077, '<td valign="top">I like the angle of view here, except for how far away you were from the lady with the red bag.</td>', 'I like the angle of view here, except for how far away you were from the lady with the red bag.', '2014-10-17 15:37:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(7274723, 1132138, 13077, '<td valign="top">Fascinating composition of grungy details and contrast and of course red!</td>', 'Fascinating composition of grungy details and contrast and of course red!', '2014-10-17 15:38:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(7274724, 1132055, 13077, '<td valign="top">I''m not crazy about how you''ve only included half of the gril. I think either less or more would have looked better.</td>', 'I''m not crazy about how you''ve only included half of the gril. I think either less or more would have looked better.', '2014-10-17 15:38:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(7274725, 1132546, 13077, '<td valign="top">Is this markwiley''s work? That''s what popped into my head when I saw it was trains.<br/>Although I like the way the scene outside the train door is composed, I wonder if inlcuding more of the scene inside of it might have been more interesting?</td>', 'Is this markwiley''s work? That''s what popped into my head when I saw it was trains.Although I like the way the scene outside the train door is composed, I wonder if inlcuding more of the scene inside of it might have been more interesting?', '2014-10-17 15:41:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(7274726, 1132232, 13077, '<td valign="top">Very red! Cool shot, those can be tough to catch for sure.</td>', 'Very red! Cool shot, those can be tough to catch for sure.', '2014-10-17 15:41:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(7274727, 1132496, 13077, '<td valign="top">The backlighting looks good, if muted, and I like the inclusion of the clouds.</td>', 'The backlighting looks good, if muted, and I like the inclusion of the clouds.', '2014-10-17 15:42:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(7274842, 1132465, 13077, '<td valign="top">I like the smoothness and rich colors, and the part of the leaf in focus is super sharp.</td>', 'I like the smoothness and rich colors, and the part of the leaf in focus is super sharp.', '2014-10-17 23:07:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(7274843, 1132466, 13077, '<td valign="top">Nice - I like the very even background, looks very two-dimensional although it clearly isn''t. Well composed.</td>', 'Nice - I like the very even background, looks very two-dimensional although it clearly isn''t. Well composed.', '2014-10-17 23:07:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(7274845, 1132232, 88291, '<td valign="top">Even the facial expression supports the mood.</td>', 'Even the facial expression supports the mood.', '2014-10-17 23:31:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(7274846, 1132554, 88291, '<td valign="top">Overall, just a bit busy.</td>', 'Overall, just a bit busy.', '2014-10-17 23:33:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(7274983, 1132557, 13077, '<td valign="top">Nice enough still life, simple and I like the boards with chipped paint as a backdrop.</td>', 'Nice enough still life, simple and I like the boards with chipped paint as a backdrop.', '2014-10-18 18:08:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(7274984, 1132561, 13077, '<td valign="top">This seems a little soft and I don''t think including all that much background was the best composition choice. Maybe it was the closest your lens can focus and clearly with these editing rules you couldn''t crop, but a vertical shot might have worked better.</td>', 'This seems a little soft and I don''t think including all that much background was the best composition choice. Maybe it was the closest your lens can focus and clearly with these editing rules you couldn''t crop, but a vertical shot might have worked better.', '2014-10-18 18:10:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(7274985, 1132468, 13077, '<td valign="top">Fascinating sculpture, and sure meets the challenge.</td>', 'Fascinating sculpture, and sure meets the challenge.', '2014-10-18 18:10:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(7274986, 1132554, 13077, '<td valign="top">I like the patches of light shining through, and even the out-of-focus things in the foreground look cool. I find it very interesting and visually appealing overall.</td>', 'I like the patches of light shining through, and even the out-of-focus things in the foreground look cool. I find it very interesting and visually appealing overall.', '2014-10-18 18:10:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(7274992, 1132503, 13077, '<td valign="top">Interesting place for sure. The composition works well, and I think this photo would look a lot better had it been done with advanced editing rules, but it''s still pretty good this way.</td>', 'Interesting place for sure. The composition works well, and I think this photo would look a lot better had it been done with advanced editing rules, but it''s still pretty good this way.', '2014-10-18 18:13:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(7274994, 1132475, 13077, '<td valign="top">I like the bold, strong patterns here, and the colors look good.</td>', 'I like the bold, strong patterns here, and the colors look good.', '2014-10-18 18:14:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(7274995, 1132537, 13077, '<td valign="top">Interesting idea, well done. I like it.</td>', 'Interesting idea, well done. I like it.', '2014-10-18 18:14:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(7274998, 1132482, 13077, '<td valign="top">Very nice. Red roses are tough to shoot but you have lit and exposed this well.</td>', 'Very nice. Red roses are tough to shoot but you have lit and exposed this well.', '2014-10-18 18:14:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(7274999, 1132515, 13077, '<td valign="top">I actually like the bold shadows from the hard light on this one - it''s unusual to see but it works. The few small water droplets are a nice touch as well.</td>', 'I actually like the bold shadows from the hard light on this one - it''s unusual to see but it works. The few small water droplets are a nice touch as well.', '2014-10-18 18:15:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(7275000, 1132547, 13077, '<td valign="top">It sure is red!</td>', 'It sure is red!', '2014-10-18 18:16:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(7275001, 1132264, 13077, '<td valign="top">Nice simple composition (although I''m guessing the branch at the top right would not be there if the rules let you clone it out), and beautiful colors of the flower.</td>', 'Nice simple composition (although I''m guessing the branch at the top right would not be there if the rules let you clone it out), and beautiful colors of the flower.', '2014-10-18 18:17:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(7275003, 1132225, 13077, '<td valign="top">I like it. Good concept and well lit/composed.</td>', 'I like it. Good concept and well lit/composed.', '2014-10-18 18:17:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(7275004, 1132562, 13077, '<td valign="top">I really like how the butterfly is out of focus but it seems intentional, beautifully done. The tones and composition are excellent.</td>', 'I really like how the butterfly is out of focus but it seems intentional, beautifully done. The tones and composition are excellent.', '2014-10-18 18:18:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(7275005, 1132216, 13077, '<td valign="top">Including the bright background here really distracts from the flower, and the color settings you used seem to have saturated the reds so much that a lot of detail gets lost.</td>', 'Including the bright background here really distracts from the flower, and the color settings you used seem to have saturated the reds so much that a lot of detail gets lost.', '2014-10-18 18:18:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(7275007, 1132260, 13077, '<td valign="top">I like the contrast between man-made and nature here. Well composed too.</td>', 'I like the contrast between man-made and nature here. Well composed too.', '2014-10-18 18:19:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(7275008, 1132385, 13077, '<td valign="top">Beautiful bird, and nicely focused and exposed - although I wonder what a vertical composition of this would look like?</td>', 'Beautiful bird, and nicely focused and exposed - although I wonder what a vertical composition of this would look like?', '2014-10-18 18:19:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(7275013, 1132538, 13077, '<td valign="top">I like how the focus falls off, and the out-of-focus background is very interesting. As is your title.</td>', 'I like how the focus falls off, and the out-of-focus background is very interesting. As is your title.', '2014-10-18 18:23:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(7275016, 1132570, 13077, '<td valign="top">Everything is more interesting from this perspective. Meets the challenge, not a bad looking ship.</td>', 'Everything is more interesting from this perspective. Meets the challenge, not a bad looking ship.', '2014-10-18 18:23:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(7275017, 1132116, 13077, '<td valign="top">I like the background, but it seems the main subject is not quite in focus, that or there''s some motion blur...</td>', 'I like the background, but it seems the main subject is not quite in focus, that or there''s some motion blur...', '2014-10-18 18:24:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(7275018, 1132307, 13077, '<td valign="top">Good concept, excellent soft light and well composed.</td>', 'Good concept, excellent soft light and well composed.', '2014-10-18 18:24:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(7275019, 1132363, 13077, '<td valign="top">I like the light and the water droplets on these flowers.</td>', 'I like the light and the water droplets on these flowers.', '2014-10-18 18:24:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(7275020, 1132147, 13077, '<td valign="top">Wow, that''s an ornate place. Perfect for the challenge, I suppose.</td>', 'Wow, that''s an ornate place. Perfect for the challenge, I suppose.', '2014-10-18 18:25:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(7275021, 1132485, 13077, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure if I like the soft glow effect or not here.</td>', 'I''m not sure if I like the soft glow effect or not here.', '2014-10-18 18:25:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(7275022, 1132202, 13077, '<td valign="top">Lots of red to be found here for sure.</td>', 'Lots of red to be found here for sure.', '2014-10-18 18:26:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(7275023, 1132287, 13077, '<td valign="top">Fascinating patterns in the water. Had cropping been allowed, it would be stronger without the out-of-focus things at the bottom.</td>', 'Fascinating patterns in the water. Had cropping been allowed, it would be stronger without the out-of-focus things at the bottom.', '2014-10-18 18:26:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(7275024, 1132204, 13077, '<td valign="top">I think another angle to have shot this from would have made it look cleaner and stronger.</td>', 'I think another angle to have shot this from would have made it look cleaner and stronger.', '2014-10-18 18:27:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(7275025, 1132479, 13077, '<td valign="top">There is some motion blur or just lack of sharpness on this one, but it''s well composed and there are some red things so it meets the challenge.</td>', 'There is some motion blur or just lack of sharpness on this one, but it''s well composed and there are some red things so it meets the challenge.', '2014-10-18 18:27:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(7275026, 1132042, 13077, '<td valign="top">Beautifully done. I''m guessing top 5 at least.</td>', 'Beautifully done. I''m guessing top 5 at least.', '2014-10-18 18:28:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(7275027, 1132250, 13077, '<td valign="top">What an interesting plant, and I like the angle you''ve shot it from.</td>', 'What an interesting plant, and I like the angle you''ve shot it from.', '2014-10-18 18:28:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(7275028, 1132552, 13077, '<td valign="top">I like the man-made vs. nature vibe here, and the contrasty light works well. I like the composition too.</td>', 'I like the man-made vs. nature vibe here, and the contrasty light works well. I like the composition too.', '2014-10-18 18:29:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(7275029, 1132374, 13077, '<td valign="top">Very nice arrangement, but while I like the soft overall feel from the lighting I think one or two stops smaller aperture would have worked better for this, and maybe moving the thing at the bottom left corner.</td>', 'Very nice arrangement, but while I like the soft overall feel from the lighting I think one or two stops smaller aperture would have worked better for this, and maybe moving the thing at the bottom left corner.', '2014-10-18 18:30:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(7275030, 1132074, 13077, '<td valign="top">I''m on the fence as to whether these foreground objects enhance or distract from the moon. A little of both maybe, if that''s possible? I do like the sort of 2 dimensional composition you''ve put together with all of the elements joining one another, and it certainly stands out from the other moon photos.</td>', 'I''m on the fence as to whether these foreground objects enhance or distract from the moon. A little of both maybe, if that''s possible? I do like the sort of 2 dimensional composition you''ve put together with all of the elements joining one another, and it certainly stands out from the other moon photos.', '2014-10-18 18:31:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(7275031, 1132157, 13077, '<td valign="top">Not a big fan of this one - there isn''t much sharpness, and the colors look a bit off.</td>', 'Not a big fan of this one - there isn''t much sharpness, and the colors look a bit off.', '2014-10-18 18:33:01.000000', NULL, 1),
